OL,3,GNEWSARolls-Royce signs 'multi-million'
OL,4,Aengine deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government welcomed the deal,
OL,7,Fsaying it would bring "good quality
OL,8,Fjobs" to the company's Derby base.
